 a recent series of papers on stratifications of configuration spaces of tensegrities (Doray, Karpenkov, Schepers, Servatius).\nL18: Subjects:  | Combinatorics (math.CO)\nL19: Cite as:  | 【9†arXiv:1902.07212】 [math.CO]\nL20:    | (or 【10†arXiv:1902.07212v4】 [math.CO] for this version)\nL21:    | 【11†https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.1902.07212†doi.org】 arXiv-issued DOI via DataCite\nL22: ## Submission history\nL23: \nL24: From: Gayane Panina Mrs [【12†view email】]\nL25: 【5†[v1]】 Tue, 19 Feb 2019 10:35:48 UTC (30 KB)\nL26: 【13†[v2]】 Sat, 2 Mar 2019 08:56:20 UTC (33 KB)\nL27: 【14†[v3]】 Wed, 17 Apr 2019 05:58:37 UTC (32 KB)\nL28: [v4] Tue, 29 Oct 2019 17:20:05 UTC (32 KB)\nL29: \nL30: Full-text links:\nL31: \nL32: ## Access Paper:\nL33: \nL34: View a PDF of the paper titled A universality theorem for stressable graphs in the plane, by Gaiane Panina\nL35: \nL36:   * 【7†View PDF】\nL37:   * 【8†HTML (experimental)】\nL38:   * 【15†TeX Source】\nL39: \nL40: 【16†view license】\nL41: ### Current browse context:\nL42: \nL43: math.CO\nL44: \nL45: 【17†< prev】   |   【18†next >】\nL46: \nL47: 【19†new】 | 【20†recent】 | 【21†2019-02】\nL48: \nL49: Change to browse by:\nL50: \nL51: 【22†math】\nL52: \nL53: ### References & Citations\nL54: \nL55:   * 【23†NASA ADS†ui.adsabs.harvard.edu】\nL56:   * 【24†Google Scholar†scholar.google.com】\nL57:   * 【25†Semantic Scholar†api.semanticscholar.org】\nL58: \nL59: [Button: export BibTeX citation] Loading...\nL60: \nL61: ## BibTeX formatted citation\nL62: \nL63: [Button: ×]\nL64: \nL65: loading...\nL66: \nL67: Data provided by:\nL68: \nL69: ### Bookmark\nL70: \nL71: [Input] Bibliographic Tools\nL72: # Bibliographic and Citation Tools\nL73: \nL74: [Input] Bibliographic Explorer Toggle\nL75: \nL76: Bibliographic Explorer (【26†What is the Explorer?†info.arxiv.org】)\nL77: \nL78: [Input] Connected Papers Toggle\nL79: \nL80: Connected Papers (【27†What is Connected Papers?†www.connectedpapers.com】)\nL81: \nL82: [Input] Litmaps Toggle\nL83: \nL84: Litmaps (【28†What is L